              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cminmd"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My son wanted some salsa with his chips so I found this easy recipe for him to make. We had really great tomatoes, so that might be why this salsa came out so yummy! I did substitute lime juice for the vinegar because I wasn't sure what type of vinegar the recipe called for- regular white vinegar or if their is some Spanish type of vinegar or something.",
